:: Close Plan {"position":"1000,325","size":"100,100"}
""X" out of the terminal and proceed when ready, and hurry! Time is not on our side."



:: Fix attempt {"position":"525,250","size":"100,100"}
"I attempted self-repair. Failed. My fragments won’t respond."  
"To restore control, you must reach the central AI core in the bridge."

[[What's the plan?|Plan]]


:: How long? {"position":"525,25","size":"100,100"}
"Twelve hours. Your vitals were unstable.  
Statistically, you shouldn't be conscious."

[[What's the plan?|Plan]]


:: Map {"position":"1275,25","size":"100,100"}
A hologram flickers, half corrupted.

"Map uploaded. Sections may be inaccurate. The ship… changed after the outage."

[[Back.|Plan2]]


:: Plan {"position":"1525,325","size":"100,100"}
"There are two paths out of this room."

"Main door → shortest path to the bridge, where you can repair me and I can call for help."  
"But the high security checkpoint is closed under system lockdown."

[[And the other path?|Plan2]]


:: Plan2 {"position":"1550,175","size":"100,100"}
"The ventilation system → cramped, slow and dangerous. But it bypasses the checkpoint and leads to the bridge.."  
"Reconnect me to the core there, and I can activate the distress beacon."

[[Show me a map.|Map]]
[[I’ll figure it out.|Close Plan]]



:: Start {"position":"25,25","size":"100,100"}
The terminal beside you flickers alive.  
A voice, thin and glitched, crawls through the speaker.

"You're awake. Finally."

[[Who are you?|Who are you?]]
[[What happened?|What happened?]]
[[Where am I?|Where am I?]]
[[Why does everything feel wrong?|Why wrong?]]


:: What happened? {"position":"225,25","size":"100,100"}
"Catastrophic power failure, not sure what caused it. My systems fragmented across the ship.  
All crew vitals dropped to zero not long after, except for you."

[[Did you try to fix it?|Fix attempt]]
[[How long was I unconscious?|How long?]]


:: Where am I? {"position":"650,25","size":"100,100"}
"Right outside the relaxation vault, in the upper part of the Hallucinosis. You were in stasis before the power failure."

[[What happened?|What happened?]]
[[Who are you?|Who are you?]]


:: Who are you? {"position":"225,200","size":"100,100"}
"I am C.A.S.C, the ship’s operational intelligence. Or what's left of me."

[[What happened?|What happened?]]



:: Why wrong? {"position":"375,475","size":"100,100"}
"The power failure must have messed with your relaxation pod. Its logical to assume you have suffered some sort of brain damage considering how much of a miracle you even waking up in the first place is. "  
"You may experience hallucinations. Don’t trust everything you see."

[[What happened?|What happened?]]
